lem]] |date=8 May 2013 |access-date=9 May 2012 |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130512050615/http://www.btselem.org/press_releases/20130509_pillar_of_defense_report |archive-date=12 May 2013 }}</ref><br />6 Palestinians killed for allegedly spying for Israel<ref>{{cite news|agency=Associated press|url=https://www.theguardian.com/world/2012/nov/20/hamas-executes-informants-israel-gaza|title=Hamas executes six suspected informants for Israel on Gaza street|work=The Guardian|date=20 November 2012|access-date=20 November 2012|archive-date=22 April 2019|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190422123631/https://www.theguardian.com/world/2012/nov/20/hamas-executes-informants-israel-gaza|url-status=live}}</ref>
